# LF = Log Form (ONE CASE ONLY)

**Chat scope:** **Email processing agent chat only** (`EMAIL-PROCESSING-AGENT.md`). Instructions dashboard must not run LF — see `.cursor/rules/instructions-only-no-re-pr-lf.mdc`.

CRITICAL: This command MUST fill ONE Roberta Case Tracker entry ONLY. Never combine or fill multiple cases at once.

**Platform:** Roberta / Yoummday Case Tracker — `https://roberta.yoummday.com/casetracker/`  
**Legacy Microsoft Forms (`forms.office.com`) is retired for LF.** Do not use shortcut tiles or NQ10061547 MS Form navigation.

When the user prompts with LF/lf or **PR LF** / **pr lf** or **LF TR** / **lf tr**:

### Close-out command map (mandatory)

| User says | Meaning | Arm after success |
|-----------|---------|-------------------|
| **PR LF** / **pr lf** (EMAIL) | **Non-transfer** answered email | **`--arm`** (detached) then **`--await-arm`** |
| **LF** alone (EMAIL) | Log form only (no PR) | **`--arm`** (detached) then **`--await-arm`** |
| **LF** alone (**CALL**) | Voice call logged (`--channel voice`) | **`--arm-next`** (detached) then **`--await-arm`** — click exact **Next** |
| **LF TR** / **lf tr** (+ optional **queue** target) | **Transfer** to queue coding | **`--arm-weiter`** (detached) then **`--await-arm`** |
| **LF TR** / **lf tr** (+ optional **email** target) | **External email transfer** | **`--arm-extern`** (detached) then **`--await-arm`** |

- **EMAIL PR LF / EMAIL LF alone** → never use `--arm-next` / `--arm-weiter` / `--arm-extern`.
- **CALL LF** → **`--arm-next`** only (never Anwenden `--arm` after a call).
- **LF TR** → never use `--arm` / `--arm-next`; never PR unless user explicitly requests a reply.
- **LF TR** email target (contains `@`) → **`--arm-extern`**; queue target → **`--arm-weiter`**.

- **PR LF:** run **PR** first (paste reply), then **LF** on the same visible Fall # → arm Anwenden.
- **LF alone:** fill tracker, then **immediately** arm Anwenden (same as after PR LF).
- **LF TR** / **lf tr** (optional `"target"`): transfer close-out — see `.cursor/rules/lf-tr-transfer.mdc`.

## BEFORE PROCEEDING

1. Identify the **currently visible case in Sprinklr** (active tab/thread). Do not require the user to restate the case ID if exactly one case is open.
2. Verify **ONE** Fall # in context. If ambiguous → STOP and ask which case ID.
3. Verify **ONE** customer (optional). If multiple names on the visible case → STOP and clarify.

## RUN LF

```powershell
uv run python .cursor/skills/fill-microsoft-form/fill_case_tracker.py --case-id "#FALL_ID"
```

Script auto-reads **Ziel / Quelle** for Transfer when `--transfer` / `--target` are omitted. **Salcus** is auto-read **only** from the exclusive Kundennummer box (below). Do **not** pass `--salcus` from email or Webform text.

### Open / reuse tracker tab

- Reuse an open `roberta.yoummday.com/casetracker/` tab if present; otherwise open a **new tab** from the Sprinklr browser context.
- Login gate → `case_tracker_nq` + `case_tracker_password` in `config.json`.
- Reuse/open Case Tracker tab; fill fields. **Do not** click **Speichern** unless the user asks (`--submit`).
- **LF leaves you on Case Tracker** after fill (Sprinklr is not forced to front).

### Field mapping (Sprinklr → Roberta)

| Roberta field | Selector | Source on Sprinklr | Rule |
|---------------|----------|-------------------|------|
| Case # | `input[name="sikas"]` | Fall # (visible case) | Digits only; `#` optional |
| Salcus | `input[name="salcus"]` | **Exclusive:** sidebar box `div[data-entityid="Kundennummer"][aria-label="Kundennummer"]`. Re-read every Fall. Value via `htmlText` or `span.spr-text-03`. **Nicht festgelegt** / missing → empty. | **Never** from email body, Webform, Betreff, Freitext, or any other DOM location. |
| Kanal | `#channel_em_care` / `#channel_voice` | **EMAIL** default: E-Mail Care. **CALL**: **Voice (Tel.)** (`#channel_voice`) | |
| Transfer | `#transfer0` / `#transfer1` | See transfer rules below | |
| Target | `input[name="target"]` | Sprinklr **Ziel** or routing rule | Only when Transfer = Ja |
| Ticketstatus Salcus | `#tstate1` / `#tstate3` | Derived — see below. **CALL always `#tstate3`** | |
| Notiz | `input[name="note"]` | — | **Always empty.** Never fill attachment counts or any other text. |

### Salcus (mandatory — exclusive source)

**Hard rule:** Roberta **Salcus** (`input[name="salcus"]`) is filled **only** from the visible-case Sprinklr sidebar box labelled **Kundennummer**. The number **changes every Fall #** — always re-read this field; never reuse a previous case’s number.

| Attribute | Required |
|-----------|----------|
| `data-entityid` | `Kundennummer` |
| `aria-label` | `Kundennummer` |
| `fieldtype` | `TEXT` (when present) |
| `data-errorid` | **Not required** (may vary) |

Selector:

`div[data-entityid="Kundennummer"][aria-label="Kundennummer"]`

**Value (inside that box only), in this order:**

1. `[data-testid="htmlText"]` — **this is how a visible number is shown** (digits; trailing NBSP is normal; strip it).
2. Else `span.spr-text-03` in `.dont-break-out` — used when the field is **Nicht festgelegt**.

Do **not** read only `spr-text-03`. That span is often absent when a number is present, and LF will wrongly leave Salcus empty.

| Displayed value | Roberta Salcus |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| Numeric Kundennummer (htmlText, digits only) | Fill those digits |
| **Vertragsnummer `C-…`** (e.g. `C-0026448826` on Fall #55920431) | **Leave empty** — not Salcus |
| **Nicht festgelegt**, empty, placeholder, or field not found | **Leave Salcus empty** |

**Forbidden sources (never):**

- Email body / Care Webform (`Kundennummer: …`, `ID Kundennummer: …`)
- `html-message-content` or any message thread
- Betreff / Freitext
- Any other DOM node that happens to contain “Kundennummer” or “Salcus”
- Historical cases, clipboard, prior LF fills, `--salcus` leftover from another case

If this exclusive field is missing or unset → Salcus empty. **Do not search anywhere else.** Ticketstatus “Kundennummer present” means **this field** has a **valid numeric** Salcus/Kundennummer — **not** a `C-` Vertragsnummer (contract ID) and not a number found in the email.

**`C-` prefix = Vertragsnummer, not Salcus:** Values like `C-0026448826` sometimes appear in the Kundennummer sidebar box (verified: Fall #55920431). Never copy to Roberta Salcus, never strip to digits. Treat like unset → Salcus empty → **3-Bot dokumentiert nicht in Salcus** (when Transfer Nein).

### Notiz (mandatory)

**Always leave Notiz empty.** Do not pass attachment counts, case comments, or any free text. The LF script clears `input[name="note"]` on every fill. There is no `--attachments` flag.

### Ticketstatus Salcus (mandatory)

| Condition | Select |
|-----------|--------|
| **CALL / Voice (Tel.)** | **3-Bot dokumentiert nicht in Salcus** (`#tstate3`) — **always**, even if Kundennummer is present |
| **Transfer = Ja** | **3-Bot dokumentiert nicht in Salcus** (`#tstate3`) — always, even if Kundennummer is present |
| **Transfer = Nein** + exclusive Kundennummer field has **valid numeric** Salcus | **1-Erfolgreich** (`#tstate1`) |
| **Transfer = Nein** + exclusive field **Nicht festgelegt** / empty / **`C-…` Vertragsnummer** | **3-Bot dokumentiert nicht in Salcus** (`#tstate3`) |

### CALL LF (Voice)

When the open Sprinklr case is a **call** (see `.cursor/rules/sprinklr-call-vs-email.mdc`):

```powershell
uv run python .cursor/skills/fill-microsoft-form/fill_case_tracker.py --case-id "#FALL_ID" --channel voice
```

- Kanal = **Voice (Tel.)** (`#channel_voice`)
- Ticketstatus Salcus = **3-Bot dokumentiert nicht in Salcus** always
- Do not use `--channel em_care` / E-Mail Care for calls

### Transfer (mandatory)

**Never log Transfer Ja to our own team.** `CBC_*_CARE_ALLGEMEIN` queues (including `CBC_XF_E_CARE_ALLGEMEIN`, `CBC_E_CARE_ALLGEMEIN`, `CBC_CARE_ALLGEMEIN`) = **we handle directly** → **Transfer: Nein**, target empty.

| Sprinklr signal | Transfer | Target |
|-----------------|----------|--------|
| **Quelle** contains **Care Widerruf** (not Care Webform) | **Ja** | `CBC_XF_E_WIDERRUF` |
| **Quelle** = Care Webform / **Ziel** = our Care team | **Nein** | (empty) — even if Betreff category path contains `\|Widerruf` |
| **Ziel** is our Care team (`*CARE_ALLGEMEIN*`) | **Nein** | (empty) |
| **Ziel** is external queue (e.g. `CBC_XF_E_WIDERRUF`, `CBC_XF_E_KUNDENDATEN`, …) | **Ja** | Ziel value |
| **Ziel** is email address | **Ja** | email |
| **Ziel** unset / **Nicht festgelegt** | **Nein** | (empty) |

Read **Ziel** from Case Informationen (`data-entityid="Ziel"` in the same section as Fallnummer/Quelle). Do not use historical-case Ziel rows.

Routing rules will be extended case-by-case in chat; script default lives in `fill_case_tracker.py` → `resolve_transfer()`.

## AFTER EXECUTION

- ONE tracker form filled for ONE case
- User clicks **Speichern** manually after sending the email
- Tracker tab may stay open for the next LF

### Auto-arm Anwenden RE (mandatory after **LF** / **PR LF** — non-transfer)

After **LF** succeeds for this Fall # — whether **LF alone**, **PR then LF**, or **PR LF** — **immediately**:

```powershell
Set-Location "c:\Users\PC ENTER\Desktop\Citrix"; uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py --arm
```

Expect **`ANWENDEN_RE_ARMED`** + **`ARM_WATCH_DETACHED`** + **`READY_FOR_YOUR_CLICK: Anwenden`** (Dexter plays = click now). Then:

```powershell
uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py --await-arm
```

Do **not** wait for typed **RE**. Arm is detached so Cursor aborting the shell does **not** kill the watch. Full rule: `.cursor/rules/re-read-email.mdc`.

**Keep awaiting** until `AWAIT_ARM_EXTRACT_DONE` / `CUSTOMER EMAIL`, then write full 7-step RE, then `re_complete_sound.py --play-ready`. If await is aborted, re-run `--await-arm` (detached watch still running) or `--once` only if log has no extract. User may click Anwenden as soon as Dexter / READY_FOR_YOUR_CLICK — do not wait for await to finish.

### Auto-arm after **CALL LF** (Voice) — disposition **Next**

After **LF** with `--channel voice` succeeds for a call Fall #:

```powershell
Set-Location "c:\Users\PC ENTER\Desktop\Citrix"; uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py --arm-next
```

Expect **`NEXT_RE_ARMED`** + **`ARM_WATCH_DETACHED`** + **`READY_FOR_YOUR_CLICK: Next`**. Finishing quote `LF done for #FALL_ID`, then **`--await-arm`**.

User left-clicks exact **Next** (`screenButton`; ignore Back / Weiter / Weiterleiten). Then 4s → next case → CHANNEL detect.

Do **not** use `--arm` (Anwenden) after CALL LF.

### Finishing quote (mandatory after LF / PR LF)

After LF + Anwenden arm is **`ANWENDEN_RE_ARMED`**:

| Close-out | Finishing quote |
|-----------|-----------------|
| **PR LF** / PR then LF | `PR LF done for #FALL_ID` |
| **LF alone** | `LF done for #FALL_ID` |

Examples: `PR LF done for #55387859` · `LF done for #55403274`  
(Dexter cue via hook.) **This must not cancel the arm watch.**

### Auto-arm transfer RE (**LF TR** only)

When the user sent **LF TR** / **lf tr** (transfer, no PR):

1. Fill tracker with **Transfer Ja** + target (RE 4a / user override).
2. After LF succeeds, arm by target type (**detached**), then **`--await-arm`**:
   - **Queue** (no `@`):
     ```powershell
     Set-Location "c:\Users\PC ENTER\Desktop\Citrix"; uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py --arm-weiter
     ```
     Expect **`WEITER_RE_ARMED`** + **`ARM_WATCH_DETACHED`**. User: Transfer → Weiterleiten → Weiteleiten → exact **Weiter**.
   - **Email** (contains `@`, e.g. `geschaeftskunden-service@telefonica.com`):
     ```powershell
     Set-Location "c:\Users\PC ENTER\Desktop\Citrix"; uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py --arm-extern
     ```
     Expect **`EXTERN_RE_ARMED`** + **`ARM_WATCH_DETACHED`**. User: Externer Transfer → exact **Weiterleiten**.
3. Finishing quote: **`LF TR done for #FALL_ID`** (Dexter via hook).
4. Then await extract:
   ```powershell
   uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py --await-arm
   ```
   If await is aborted, re-run `--await-arm`. Do **not** use `--arm` (Anwenden) for this path.

Full rule: `.cursor/rules/lf-tr-transfer.mdc`.

VIOLATION OF THIS RULE = DATA BREACH. DO NOT PROCEED IF UNCERTAIN.
